WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
Many believers say God
made the whole universe,

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.420
and is greater than all of it.

3
00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:10.540
In the book of Isaiah, God says:
My thoughts are not your thoughts.

4
00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:16.120
Yet every day, believers pray, trusting
a God who listens and responds.

5
00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:21.410
So if God is beyond the whole universe,
how can God also be close enough to hear

6
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.450
one person's prayer?

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.920
In this mission, you'll learn the words
believers use for God's greatness:

8
00:00:27.970 --> 00:00:31.430
all-powerful, all-knowing, all-loving.

9
00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:35.240
Then you'll test what each
of these words really means.

10
00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:40.540
Your mission: find out how believers
describe a God beyond the universe who still

11
00:00:40.590 --> 00:00:41.560
hears prayer.
